<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>4.14.3: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01119</md:content-id>
    <md:title>4.14.3: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>813da34c-5446-474b-b5a5-499cbfe8b891</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <note class="self-check"><title>Self Check</title>
<para>The table below shows the number of checkers and the number of moves needed to win a skipping game.</para>
<table class="os-raise-horizontaltable">
  <tgroup cols="5"><tbody><row>
      <entry><emphasis>Number of Checkers</emphasis></entry><entry>
        1
      </entry>
      <entry>
        2
      </entry>
      <entry>
        3
      </entry>
      <entry>
        4
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry><emphasis>Number of Skips Needed</emphasis></entry><entry>
        2
      </entry>
      <entry>
        8
      </entry>
      <entry>
        18
      </entry>
      <entry>
        32
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody></tgroup></table>

<para>How many skips are needed with 6 checkers on each side?</para></note>
</content>
</document>